1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:10,500
上載示例單據；OCR 文字識別讀出項目和價錢，再翻譯成你選擇的語言。
Upload a sample receipt; OCR reads items and prices, then translates them into your chosen language.

2
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:14,100
原文留低俾你核對，方便分帳。
Keep the original for review before splitting the bill.

3
00:00:14,636 --> 00:00:24,736
先核對單據項目和金額；有錯先按「改」。
服務費填實際金額。
Check items and amounts; edit only mistakes.
Enter the actual service-fee amount.

4
00:00:24,736 --> 00:00:35,036
設定活動名稱和期限後按「確定」，畫面會移到分享區。
分享認帳連結後，即使未有回覆也可去第三步。
Set the activity name and expiry, then Confirm to open sharing.
Share the claim link; continue to Step 3 before replies arrive.

5
00:00:35,036 --> 00:00:45,136
第三步設定墊支人、結算貨幣、付款方式和服務費分法。
Step 3 sets payer, currency, payment methods, and fee splitting.

6
00:00:45,136 --> 00:00:55,136
認帳回覆在設定下面。未收到回覆仍可完成前面設定。
沒有有效認帳時，「產生分帳報告」會停用。
Replies appear below settings. Finish settings first.
Generate Report stays disabled without a valid claim.

7
00:00:55,136 --> 00:01:08,036
核對有效回覆後按「產生分帳報告」。網頁版同一條連結為首選。
簡單版和詳細版是後備方案，需要時才展開。
After checking replies, generate the report. The original link is preferred.
Summary and Detailed are backups; expand only when needed.
